{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","title":"Trusted publishing memverifikasi origin, bukan kontrol publish","desc":"Trusted publishing di npm/GitHub memverifikasi identitas dan workflow CI, tetapi tidak membuktikan bahwa publish dilakukan di bawah kontrol yang aman.","updated":1778647444179,"created":1778647244689,"tags":["zettel","security","supply-chain","provenance"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"040f8603cffffd6c55561e0c0c0dce47","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","id":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","id":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.security","alias":"security","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.security"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","id":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.supply-chain","alias":"supply-chain","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.supply-chain"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","id":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.provenance","alias":"provenance","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.provenance"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.tanstack-postmortem","id":"notes.security.tanstack-postmortem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":157,"column":3,"offset":7924},"end":{"line":157,"column":55,"offset":7976},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.trusted-publishing-authenticity-vs-agency"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"trusted-publishing-memverifikasi-origin-bukan-kontrol-publish\">Trusted publishing memverifikasi origin, bukan kontrol publish<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#trusted-publishing-memverifikasi-origin-bukan-kontrol-publish\"></a></h1>\n<p>Trusted publishing di konteks npm adalah mekanisme kriptografis untuk membuktikan siapa yang menerbitkan paket dan melalui workflow CI mana. Itu menjawab pertanyaan \"siapa\" dan \"dari mana\", bukan pertanyaan \"apakah actor masih memegang kontrol\".</p>\n<p>Karena attacker bisa mengendalikan maintainer atau runner yang sah, provenance tetap bisa valid meskipun intent dan kontrol sudah hilang. Maka provenance adalah sinyal authenticity, bukan jaminan safety.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">supply-chain (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">provenance (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.tanstack-postmortem\">TanStack npm supply-chain compromise — postmortem notes</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"en